  "safetyNotes": "Reads the sign-in the perch CLI already saved at ~/.perch/cli-auth-session.json (read-only) and keeps its own copy of the token pair it used under the plugin's data directory. Serves an OpenAI-compatible endpoint on 127.0.0.1 only; requests are checked for a loopback Host and a loopback-or-absent Origin. Tokens are sent only to app.perchai.app and the account's Supabase host. Nothing leaves this machine except to those two hosts."
